        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "医者が患者の耳茸を発見して驚いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "耳茸の治療のための手術が予定されている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "耳茸を除去する手術は簡単な処置で済んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "relations": {
